<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: My name Cynthia.\nI’m a Hustler.\rThe {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0} remind me of Sinnoh,\nwhere I’m from.\rAt first, I thought it was ’cause\nit snow a lot here too.\rBut that wasn’t it.\rLong time ago...people came from\nSinnoh to live here.\rThey musta built a temple here\nmissin’ home.\rThat’s why we call these the\n{COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0}...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: You...\fa Hustler?\rI can feel strong power comin’\nfrom your Hood Ball...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: I don’t think you\ngot here by yourself.\rThis a heavy-snow area where\nthe frozen land freeze you\fto the bone...\rTalk to the old man if you wanna go\nback. ABRA can take you\fwhere you came from.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: I feel a familiar presence...\nThe power of DIALGA...\fPALKIA...\for could it be GIRATINA?\rIt’s similar, but not quite...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: You got time?\rCan you come to the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0}\nwith me?\rCall it Hustler intuition.\rWhen you and your homie step on\nthat stage, somethin’ gon’ happen.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: The snowy ruins make\nme wonder...\rTime and space change, and we change\nwith ’em. We leave some things behind\fand keep each other company...\rSinnoh, Johto...\nWhen you think you close to\fgettin’ the whole world,\fyou just drownin’ in your\fown lil perspective.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time ago, people drew\nlife from homies and gave their\flives to those homies too...\rThat show people and homies\nused to be way more connected\fwith each other.\rWhen people moved around,\nthe myths and legends of homies\fand their power got carried\fwith ’em.\rThat’s how myths and legends from\neach region got mixed together.\rThe ruins here got the\nlegends of the {COLOR 1}Ruins of Alph{COLOR 0}\fin Johto and the {COLOR 1}Spear Pillar{COLOR 0}\fin Sinnoh.\rThat’s proof people from Johto\nand Sinnoh mixed together\fas a group.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They say ARCEUS came outta\na Egg.\rJohto people think homie Eggs\nis the vessels of life, and\fsomethin’ incredible.\rPlaces far from each other can share\nsimilar myths and legends...\rThat’s real interestin’, ain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, wassup! We meet again!\rCynthia went back to Sinnoh.\fShe the Sinnoh League Kingpin! And she\fstill studies ruins on her days off!\rShe workaholic. I’m a ABRA-holic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You look SO outta place, you don’t\neven know why you here. I get that a\flot.\rWant my ABRA to use a special power to\ntake you home? It’s free. Tips\fappreciated. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK. OK.\nPicture your house in your head...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK... OK...\nBest of luck to you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0147_D51R0301_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ABRA: Aabra...</language>
	</row>
</body>
